{
  "Combat.FrogGirlRed.Poison.Hit": " Her skin making contact with yours begins to make you feel a little woozy..."
  "Combat.FrogGirlRed.Poison.Lead": "The red frog-girl kicks you with her powerful legs."
  "Combat.FrogGirlRed.Poison.Miss": " You twist out of the way of her legs."
